{
  "name": "all-gated-out",
  "domain": "project-management",
  "format": "task-graph",
  "description": "每一类 P1 闸门至少命中一次，6 个候选里 5 个被排除，且各自由不同的谓词排除。用途是证明两件事：闸门谓词是文档级的（图域也必须能被文件级闸门治理），以及「P0 产出为空」与「P1 排除了几乎全部」在 plan 里是可区分的。注：`project/notes/untracked.txt` 的候选在被 extension 谓词排除之前，**还有一条被 P0 源头排除的边**（已下线计划里的 X1 → X2），因此这里同时验证了 source 级排除与 gate 级排除是两条可区分的路径。",
  "input": {
    "format": "task-graph",
    "payload": {
      "documents": [
        {
          "path": "project/legacy-plan.json",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 2048,
            "deleted": true
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "X1",
                "title": "已下线计划里的任务",
                "owner": "alice",
                "estimateDays": 2,
                "status": "todo",
                "dependsOn": [
                  "X2"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "X2",
                "title": "已下线计划里的上游",
                "owner": "bob",
                "estimateDays": 1,
                "status": "todo"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "project/attachments/board-media.json",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 1024,
            "binary": true
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "B1",
                "title": "只登记在白板照片里的任务",
                "owner": "carol",
                "status": "todo",
                "attachmentOnly": true
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "project/notes/untracked.txt",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 512
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "N1",
                "title": "写在记事本里的任务",
                "owner": "dave",
                "estimateDays": 1,
                "status": "todo"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "node_modules/pm-tool/export.json",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 8192
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "Z1",
                "title": "第三方工具自带的样例任务",
                "owner": "tool",
                "estimateDays": 1,
                "status": "todo"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "archived/2025-plan.json",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 8192
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "A1",
                "title": "上个季度归档的计划",
                "owner": "erin",
                "estimateDays": 1,
                "status": "todo"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 6,
    "paths": [
      "project/legacy-plan-task-x1.json",
      "project/legacy-plan-task-x2.json",
      "project/attachments/board-media-task-b1.json",
      "project/notes/untracked-task-n1.txt",
      "node_modules/pm-tool/export-task-z1.json",
      "archived/2025-plan-task-a1.json"
    ],
    "admitted": 0,
    "excludedByPredicate": {
      "extension": [
        "project/notes/untracked-task-n1.txt"
      ],
      "binary": [
        "project/attachments/board-media-task-b1.json"
      ],
      "deleted": [
        "project/legacy-plan-task-x1.json",
        "project/legacy-plan-task-x2.json"
      ],
      "user-exclude": [
        "archived/2025-plan-task-a1.json",
        "node_modules/pm-tool/export-task-z1.json"
      ]
    },
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "被闸门排除不影响锚点重算 —— 锚点验证的是图上的事实，不是准入决定。这条边在图里真实存在。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/legacy-plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "X1",
            "to": "X2"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/legacy-plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/legacy-plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "X1",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "X2"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "X2"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/legacy-plan.json"
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "图上只有 X1 → X2，声明写成 X2 依赖 X1。反向边必须被判矛盾。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/legacy-plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "X2",
            "to": "X1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/legacy-plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/legacy-plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "X1",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "X2"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "X2"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch"
      }
    ]
  }
}